/**
 * Consulting page: frameworks section.
 */
---

<div
  class="vb-element vb-element-045dab9 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent"
  data-id="045dab9"
  data-element_type="container"
  data-e-type="container"
  data-settings={'{"background_background":"classic"}'}
>
  <div class="e-con-inner">
    <div
      class="vb-element vb-element-bd6f4a8 vb-widget__width-initial vb-widget vb-widget-text-editor"
      data-id="bd6f4a8"
      data-element_type="widget"
      data-e-type="widget"
      data-widget_type="text-editor.default"
    >
      <div class="vb-widget-container">
        <p class="p1">
          Our consulting engagements are supported by VentureBean’s proprietary frameworks and methodologies, including
          the <span class="s1"><b>PPTG Framework</b></span>, DMAICR Methodology, <span class="s1"
            ><b>Business Scalability Assessment</b></span
          >, and <span class="s1"><b>Z Framework</b></span>.
        </p><p class="p1">
          These frameworks help organisations improve business performance, strengthen leadership capability, optimise
          operations, and build scalable businesses. The result is a practical, outcome-focused consulting approach that
          helps businesses improve performance, strengthen leadership, optimise operations, and build sustainable
          growth.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div
      class="vb-element vb-element-52c7203 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child"
